{"id":"n18917-1-5","stage":5,"title":"당혹 · 不知所措","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18917-1-5-1","ko":"아까 보니까 유민이가 당혹을 한 얼굴을 하고 있던데, 무슨 일 있어?","zh":"刚才看到裕敏一脸困惑的样子，发生什么事了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚，刚才","explanation":"아까：刚，刚才","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65975","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보니까","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"유민이가","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"당혹을","meaning":"不知所措，恐慌，惊慌，困惑","explanation":"당혹：不知所措，恐慌，惊慌，困惑；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"당혹","audio":"/audio/809dde138b7ae3763218.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18917","senseId":"1","lemma":"당혹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한","meaning":"做出、产生（당혹을 하다：感到困惑、不知所措）","explanation":"하다：做出、产生（당혹을 하다：感到困惑、不知所措）；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼굴을","meaning":"脸色","explanation":"얼굴：脸色；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"얼굴","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17183","senseId":"3","lemma":"얼굴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하고","meaning":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있던데,","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；던데：回顾亲历的情况，作为后文的背景或对比。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일","meaning":"事，事情","explanation":"일：事，事情","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"3","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚，刚才","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65975","definition":"前不久。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"809dde138b7ae376","term":"당혹","zh":"不知所措，恐慌，惊慌，困惑","audio":"/audio/809dde138b7ae3763218.mp3","entryId":"18917","definition":"由于突然遭遇某事而六神无主、不知所措。","pronunciation":["당혹"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做出、产生（당혹을 하다：感到困惑、不知所措）；表示两个以上的并列或反复。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做出、产生（당혹을 하다：感到困惑、不知所措）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"886ae927b512e2e4","term":"얼굴","zh":"脸色","audio":"/audio/886ae927b512e2e4bc7b.mp3","entryId":"17183","definition":"某种心理状态表露于外的表情。","pronunciation":["얼굴"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带有某种内容的情况或事实。","pronunciation":["일ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf282a91553e1f8afd59.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18917-1-5-2","ko":"유민이가 방금 화장실에서 지갑을 잃어버렸대.","zh":"裕敏说她刚才在洗手间里丢了钱包。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민이가","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"유민이가","audio":"/audio/9f714db1c17c8ecf0221.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화장실에서","meaning":"洗手间，卫生间","explanation":"화장실：洗手间，卫生间；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"화장실","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30211","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지갑을","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잃어버렸대.","meaning":"丢，丢失，遗失","explanation":"잃어버리다：丢，丢失，遗失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"잃어버리다","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68753","senseId":"1","lemma":"잃어버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"477b8e1cccfde276","term":"화장실","zh":"洗手间，卫生间","audio":"/audio/477b8e1cccfde276bae7.mp3","entryId":"30211","definition":"设有供大便和小便排出体外的设施的地方。","pronunciation":["화장실"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"9cf9d89321e22dcf","term":"잃어버리다","zh":"丢，丢失，遗失","audio":"/audio/9cf9d89321e22dcf7c31.mp3","entryId":"68753","definition":"丢掉原本拥有的东西而不再拥有。","pronunciation":["이러버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7e7e9a0922972637764b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.165,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18917","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":151,"sequenceScore":2.9917,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["裕敏说她刚才在洗手间里丢了钱包。","刚才看到裕敏一脸困惑的样子，发生什么事了吗？","你有什么特别爱吃或爱喝的嗜好品吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["刚才看到裕敏一脸困惑的样子，发生什么事了吗？","你有什么特别爱吃或爱喝的嗜好品吗？","裕敏说她刚才在洗手间里丢了钱包。"],"answer":2}]}
